# makes every spawned bot restore the provisioned browser session (make login) and join signed-in.
# BOT_S3_* are SCOPED userdata-store credentials — never the deployment's admin S3 creds. With
# BOT_S3_ENDPOINT=http://storage:9000 the storage-init step creates that key pair as an account on
# the in-stack storage and limits it to BOT_USERDATA_S3_PATH with a bucket policy.
